 documentary was informative.","exampleCn":"这部纪录片很有知识性。"},{"id":844,"word":"restriction","example":"There are restrictions on smoking.","exampleCn":"吸烟有限制。"},{"id":845,"word":"absence","example":"His absence was noticed.","exampleCn":"他的缺席被注意到了。"},{"id":846,"word":"sensitive","example":"She is sensitive to criticism.","exampleCn":"她对批评敏感。"},{"id":847,"word":"pattern","example":"The pattern is repeating.","exampleCn":"模式在重复。"},{"id":848,"word":"commercial","example":"The commercial break is coming.","exampleCn":"广告时间要到了。"},{"id":849,"word":"tough","example":"The material is tough.","exampleCn":"这种材料很坚韧。"}]